================================================================================
Data Sources
================================================================================

BIC/SWIFT data is sourced from GLEIF (Global Legal Entity Identifier
Foundation) under CC0 1.0 Universal Public Domain Dedication:
  https://www.gleif.org/en/about/open-data

Swiss BC-Nummer / clearing data is sourced from SIX Group AG BankMaster:
  https://www.six-group.com/en/products-services/banking-services/payment-services/bc-bank-master.html

Country risk indicators are derived from publicly available FATF
(Financial Action Task Force) and EU sanctions lists.
